{
  "_instructions": "Reviewed example only. Replace endpoint, credential paths and every exporter-specific expression with the accepted private deployment mapping. cognistore_pilot_* are explicit exporter contract examples, not metrics supplied by the application. No absent()/or vector(0) fallbacks: unknown is a failed observation. Timestamp expressions must return the oldest underlying source sample timestamp, not the instant-query evaluation timestamp. Include every operand when computing resource ratios.",
  "endpoint": "https://prometheus.private.example/api/v1/query",
